  <data key="d37">Broader, tighter sanctions that restrict payment channels, financing and insurance for a supplier reduce its effective exports and buyers' ability to replenish, leading commercial fuel inventories to be drawn down.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
