  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter and broader sanctions directly restrict correspondent banking and investor access, force portfolio rebalancing away from targeted jurisdictions, and thus reduce net cross-border capital flows into affected sovereign debt markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
