  <data key="d37">Tighter sanctions and export controls rapidly block shipments of advanced accelerators, specialized servers, and cloud services to targeted states and firms, directly reducing usable high‑performance compute available to those actors and tightening global supply for competing parties.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_gulf_conflict</data>
