  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Direct attacks and harassment of LNG carriers and terminals create shipping delays and higher insurance/freight costs and can cause short-term supply shortfalls that push up wholesale gas benchmark prices.</data>
