  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Declines in refinery operational availability reduce fuel supplies for power plants and diesel backup, forcing some data‑center operators to throttle workloads, run on reduced redundancy, or postpone commissioning new capacity.</data>
