  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Step changes in model capability enable faster, more aggressive algorithmic trading, model-driven hedging and cross-asset arbitrage that can amplify order flow and create short-term dislocations, raising intraday sovereign bond volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_geopolitical_riv</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_shift</data>
