  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Public demonstration or rapid deployment of higher-performing AI models (e.g., autonomous targeting, credible deepfakes, or advanced ISR analytics) increases public and elite perceptions of vulnerability and uncertainty, raising perceived external threat levels.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_geopolitical_riv</data>
