<edge source="tech_ai_geopolitical_riv::ai_capital_flow" target="global_financial_shift::cross_border_flows" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid rise in AI-directed fundraising and infrastructure investment attracts international institutional and private capital into private equity and offshore AI infrastructure projects, mechanically diverting net cross-border inflows away from developed-market sovereign debt issuance and reducing measured sovereign inflows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_geopolitical_riv</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="tech_ai_geopolitical_riv::ai_capital_flow" target="global_financial_shift::market_liquidity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Large, concentrated AI financing and secondary transactions withdraw balance-sheet capacity from prime brokers and liquidity providers and reallocate dealer inventories to tech positions, reducing depth and increasing bid‑ask spreads in sovereign bond markets.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_geopolitical_riv</data>
  <data key="d40">global_financial_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="tech_ai_geopolitical_riv::ai_capital_flow" target="russia_ukraine_war::military_capability_bala" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in AI investment channels funding directly to defense contractors and procurement programs, accelerating development and fielding of AI-enabled sensors, fire‑control, logistics and autonomous systems that raise one side's effective combat capabilities relative to the other.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_ai_geopolitical_riv</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
