  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved liquidity in sovereign and credit markets lowers frictions and borrowing costs for cloud providers and HPC buyers, accelerating procurement of accelerators and related infrastructure and thus expanding usable compute capacity.</data>
