  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden drying of market liquidity raises margin calls and short-term funding costs for commodity traders and tanker owners, forcing the cancellation or postponement of shipments through Gulf chokepoints and thereby reducing oil flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_shift</data>
